#: src/reference/lints.md:343
msgid "`redundant_homepage`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/lints.md:352
msgid ""
"Checks if the value of `package.homepage` is already covered by another "
"field."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/lints.md:354
msgid ""
"See also [`package.homepage` reference documentation](manifest.md#the-"
"homepage-field)."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/lints.md:358
msgid ""
"When package browsers render each link, a redundant link adds visual noise."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/lints.md:364
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[package]\n"
"name = \"foo\"\n"
"homepage = \"https://github.com/rust-lang/cargo/\"\n"
"repository = \"https://github.com/rust-lang/cargo/\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/lints.md:373
